  "description": "Binary search primer: loop invariants, exact match vs lower/upper bound, the first-true template, off-by-one rules, rotated arrays, peak finding, 2D matrix search and floor lookups in time-stamped records, with Go, C++, Java and Python templates.",
  "hero": {
