      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\r\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span><span class=\"chip\">Pattern primer</span><span class=\"chip\">O(log n)</span><span class=\"chip\">Invariants</span></div>\r\n  <h1>Binary Search</h1>\r\n  <p class=\"lead\">Halve the search space with a loop invariant you can state out loud, and the off-by-one bugs go away. Exact match with a closed range, lower and upper bound with a half-open range, the one \"first true\" template behind them, rotated arrays, peak finding, 2D matrix search and floor lookups in time-stamped records. Templates in Go, C++, Java and Python.</p>\r\n  <p class=\"small prereq\"><b>Go deeper:</b> <a href=\"{{BASE}}coding/coding-binary-search-on-answer\">Binary search on the answer</a>.</p>\r\n"
  },
